{"seq":2,"slug":"scopes-and-bindings","title":"作用域与绑定","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/dependency-injection/scopes-and-bindings","wordCount":685,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"作用域与绑定\">作用域与绑定</h1><p>Hilt 的作用域机制控制依赖的生命周期范围，绑定策略决定如何提供依赖实例。正确使用作用域和高级绑定功能是构建高效、可维护的依赖注入体系的关键。</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>作用域与绑定围绕四个核心概念：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>作用域 = 生命周期边界</strong>：<code>@Singleton</code>（进程）、<code>@ActivityRetainedScoped</code>（跨配置变更）、<code>@ViewModelScoped</code>（ViewModel）、<code>@ActivityScoped</code> / <code>@FragmentScoped</code>（组件实例）逐级收窄；无作用域注解则每次注入都新建实例。</li>\n<li><strong>按需选择而非滥用</strong>：重量级、需共享的对象才设 <code>@Singleton</code>，否则会长期占用内存；作用域应基于依赖真实的生命周期需求决定。</li>\n<li><strong>自定义组件</strong>：<code>@DefineComponent</code> 配合 <code>@Scope</code> 注解可创建标准层级之外的组件，满足特殊生命周期。</li>\n<li><strong>Multibindings</strong>：<code>@IntoSet</code> / <code>@IntoMap</code> 把多个实现收集成 Set 或 Map，适合插件化与策略模式。</li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"singleton\">@Singleton</h2><p><code>@Singleton</code> 是最常用的作用域，确保在整个应用生命周期内只创建一个实例。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@Singleton&#10;class AppDatabase @Inject constructor(&#10;    @ApplicationContext private val context: Context&#10;) {&#10;    val db = Room.databaseBuilder(context, MyDatabase::class.java, &quot;app.db&quot;).build()&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Module&#10;@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)&#10;object AppModule {&#10;&#10;    @Provides&#10;    @Singleton&#10;    fun provideHttpClient(): OkHttpClient {&#10;        return OkHttpClient.Builder()&#10;            .addInterceptor(AuthInterceptor())&#10;            .build()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    @Provides&#10;    @Singleton&#10;    fun provideJson(): Json {&#10;        return Json {&#10;            ignoreUnknownKeys = true&#10;            coerceInputValues = true&#10;            prettyPrint = false&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class AppDatabase @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @ApplicationContext private val context: Context</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val db = Room.databaseBuilder(context, MyDatabase::class.java, \"app.db\").build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>object AppModule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideHttpClient(): OkHttpClient {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return OkHttpClient.Builder()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .addInterceptor(AuthInterceptor())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            .build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Provides</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun provideJson(): Json {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        return Json {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            ignoreUnknownKeys = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            coerceInputValues = true</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            prettyPrint = false</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>使用与不使用作用域的区别：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>有 @Singleton</th>\n<th>无作用域注解</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>全局唯一实例</td>\n<td>每次注入新建实例</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>首次注入时创建</td>\n<td>每次注入时创建</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>占用内存直到进程结束</td>\n<td>使用后可被 GC 回收</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>适合重量级对象</td>\n<td>适合轻量级/无状态对象</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> 不要过度使用 <code>@Singleton</code>，只有确实需要全局共享的对象才应该设为单例，否则会增加内存占用。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"viewmodelscoped\">@ViewModelScoped</h2><p><code>@ViewModelScoped</code> 将依赖绑定到 ViewModel 的生命周期，同一 ViewModel 内注入的多个位置共享同一实例。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@ViewModelScoped&#10;class CartStateHolder @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val cartRepository: CartRepository&#10;) {&#10;    private val _items = MutableStateFlow&lt;List&lt;CartItem&gt;&gt;(emptyList())&#10;    val items = _items.asStateFlow()&#10;&#10;    suspend fun addItem(item: CartItem) {&#10;        cartRepository.add(item)&#10;        _items.update { it + item }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@HiltViewModel&#10;class CheckoutViewModel @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val cartStateHolder: CartStateHolder,&#10;    private val paymentService: PaymentService&#10;) : ViewModel() {&#10;&#10;    val cartItems = cartStateHolder.items&#10;&#10;    fun checkout() {&#10;        viewModelScope.launch {&#10;            paymentService.process(cartItems.value)&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@ViewModelScoped</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class CartStateHolder @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val cartRepository: CartRepository</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val _items = MutableStateFlow&#x3C;List&#x3C;CartItem>>(emptyList())</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val items = _items.asStateFlow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun addItem(item: CartItem) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        cartRepository.add(item)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _items.update { it + item }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@HiltViewModel</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class CheckoutViewModel @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val cartStateHolder: CartStateHolder,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val paymentService: PaymentService</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) : ViewModel() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val cartItems = cartStateHolder.items</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun checkout() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        viewModelScope.launch {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>            paymentService.process(cartItems.value)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[&quot;@Singleton 作用域&quot;] --&gt; B[&quot;@ActivityRetainedScoped&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; C[&quot;@ViewModelScoped&quot;]&#10;    B --&gt; D[&quot;@ActivityScoped&quot;]&#10;    D --&gt; E[&quot;@FragmentScoped&quot;]&#10;&#10;    A --- F[应用生命周期]&#10;    B --- G[跨配置变更]&#10;    C --- H[ViewModel 生命周期]&#10;    D --- I[Activity 实例生命周期]&#10;    E --- J[Fragment 实例生命周期]&#10;&#10;    classDef scopeStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class A,B,C,D,E scopeStyle\">graph TD\n    A[\"@Singleton 作用域\"] --&gt; B[\"@ActivityRetainedScoped\"]\n    B --&gt; C[\"@ViewModelScoped\"]\n    B --&gt; D[\"@ActivityScoped\"]\n    D --&gt; E[\"@FragmentScoped\"]\n\n    A --- F[应用生命周期]\n    B --- G[跨配置变更]\n    C --- H[ViewModel 生命周期]\n    D --- I[Activity 实例生命周期]\n    E --- J[Fragment 实例生命周期]\n\n    classDef scopeStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class A,B,C,D,E scopeStyle</pre><hr>\n<h2 id=\"activityretainedscoped\">@ActivityRetainedScoped</h2><p><code>@ActivityRetainedScoped</code> 的生命周期跨越配置变更，类似 ViewModel 的存活范围。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@ActivityRetainedScoped&#10;class SessionManager @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val authRepository: AuthRepository,&#10;    private val tokenStore: TokenStore&#10;) {&#10;    private val _authState = MutableStateFlow&lt;AuthState&gt;(AuthState.Unknown)&#10;    val authState = _authState.asStateFlow()&#10;&#10;    suspend fun login(credentials: Credentials) {&#10;        val token = authRepository.authenticate(credentials)&#10;        tokenStore.saveToken(token)&#10;        _authState.value = AuthState.Authenticated(token.userId)&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun logout() {&#10;        tokenStore.clearToken()&#10;        _authState.value = AuthState.Unauthenticated&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;sealed interface AuthState {&#10;    data object Unknown : AuthState&#10;    data class Authenticated(val userId: String) : AuthState&#10;    data object Unauthenticated : AuthState&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@ActivityRetainedScoped</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class SessionManager @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val authRepository: AuthRepository,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val tokenStore: TokenStore</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val _authState = MutableStateFlow&#x3C;AuthState>(AuthState.Unknown)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val authState = _authState.asStateFlow()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    suspend fun login(credentials: Credentials) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        val token = authRepository.authenticate(credentials)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        tokenStore.saveToken(token)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _authState.value = AuthState.Authenticated(token.userId)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun logout() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        tokenStore.clearToken()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        _authState.value = AuthState.Unauthenticated</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>sealed interface AuthState {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data object Unknown : AuthState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data class Authenticated(val userId: String) : AuthState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    data object Unauthenticated : AuthState</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>各作用域对比：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>作用域</th>\n<th>组件</th>\n<th>存活范围</th>\n<th>典型用途</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td><code>@Singleton</code></td>\n<td><code>SingletonComponent</code></td>\n<td>进程生命周期</td>\n<td>网络客户端、数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@ActivityRetainedScoped</code></td>\n<td><code>ActivityRetainedComponent</code></td>\n<td>跨配置变更</td>\n<td>会话管理器</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@ViewModelScoped</code></td>\n<td><code>ViewModelComponent</code></td>\n<td>ViewModel 存活期</td>\n<td>共享状态持有者</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@ActivityScoped</code></td>\n<td><code>ActivityComponent</code></td>\n<td>Activity 实例</td>\n<td>Activity 级缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><code>@FragmentScoped</code></td>\n<td><code>FragmentComponent</code></td>\n<td>Fragment 实例</td>\n<td>Fragment 级状态</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"自定义组件\">自定义组件</h2><p>Hilt 允许创建自定义组件来满足特殊的作用域需求。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"@DefineComponent(parent = SingletonComponent::class)&#10;@UserScope&#10;interface UserComponent&#10;&#10;@DefineComponent.Builder&#10;interface UserComponentBuilder {&#10;    fun setUser(@BindsInstance user: User): UserComponentBuilder&#10;    fun build(): UserComponent&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Scope&#10;@Retention(AnnotationRetention.RUNTIME)&#10;annotation class UserScope&#10;&#10;@UserScope&#10;class UserAnalytics @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val user: User,&#10;    private val tracker: AnalyticsTracker&#10;) {&#10;    fun trackAction(action: String) {&#10;        tracker.track(action, mapOf(&quot;userId&quot; to user.id))&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Singleton&#10;class UserComponentManager @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val builder: Provider&lt;UserComponentBuilder&gt;&#10;) {&#10;    private var component: UserComponent? = null&#10;&#10;    fun createComponent(user: User) {&#10;        component = builder.get().setUser(user).build()&#10;    }&#10;&#10;    fun destroyComponent() {&#10;        component = null&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>@DefineComponent(parent = SingletonComponent::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@UserScope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface UserComponent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@DefineComponent.Builder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>interface UserComponentBuilder {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun setUser(@BindsInstance user: User): UserComponentBuilder</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun build(): UserComponent</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Scope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Retention(AnnotationRetention.RUNTIME)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>annotation class UserScope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@UserScope</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class UserAnalytics @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val user: User,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val tracker: AnalyticsTracker</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun trackAction(action: String) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        tracker.track(action, mapOf(\"userId\" to user.id))</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class UserComponentManager @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val builder: Provider&#x3C;UserComponentBuilder></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private var component: UserComponent? = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun createComponent(user: User) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        component = builder.get().setUser(user).build()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun destroyComponent() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        component = null</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"multibindings\">Multibindings</h2><p>Multibindings 允许将多个绑定收集到 Set 或 Map 中，适合插件化架构。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"kotlin\" data-code=\"interface FeatureInitializer {&#10;    fun initialize()&#10;    val priority: Int&#10;}&#10;&#10;class AnalyticsInitializer @Inject constructor() : FeatureInitializer {&#10;    override fun initialize() { /* 初始化分析 */ }&#10;    override val priority = 1&#10;}&#10;&#10;class CrashReporterInitializer @Inject constructor() : FeatureInitializer {&#10;    override fun initialize() { /* 初始化崩溃报告 */ }&#10;    override val priority = 0&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Module&#10;@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)&#10;abstract class InitializerModule {&#10;&#10;    @Binds&#10;    @IntoSet&#10;    abstract fun bindAnalytics(impl: AnalyticsInitializer): FeatureInitializer&#10;&#10;    @Binds&#10;    @IntoSet&#10;    abstract fun bindCrashReporter(impl: CrashReporterInitializer): FeatureInitializer&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Singleton&#10;class AppInitializer @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val initializers: Set&lt;@JvmSuppressWildcards FeatureInitializer&gt;&#10;) {&#10;    fun initializeAll() {&#10;        initializers.sortedBy { it.priority }.forEach { it.initialize() }&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Module&#10;@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)&#10;abstract class HandlerModule {&#10;&#10;    @Binds&#10;    @IntoMap&#10;    @StringKey(&quot;push&quot;)&#10;    abstract fun bindPushHandler(impl: PushNotificationHandler): NotificationHandler&#10;&#10;    @Binds&#10;    @IntoMap&#10;    @StringKey(&quot;email&quot;)&#10;    abstract fun bindEmailHandler(impl: EmailNotificationHandler): NotificationHandler&#10;}&#10;&#10;@Singleton&#10;class NotificationDispatcher @Inject constructor(&#10;    private val handlers: Map&lt;String, @JvmSuppressWildcards NotificationHandler&gt;&#10;) {&#10;    fun dispatch(type: String, payload: NotificationPayload) {&#10;        handlers[type]?.handle(payload)&#10;    }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>interface FeatureInitializer {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun initialize()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    val priority: Int</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class AnalyticsInitializer @Inject constructor() : FeatureInitializer {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun initialize() { /* 初始化分析 */ }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override val priority = 1</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class CrashReporterInitializer @Inject constructor() : FeatureInitializer {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override fun initialize() { /* 初始化崩溃报告 */ }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    override val priority = 0</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>abstract class InitializerModule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Binds</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @IntoSet</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    abstract fun bindAnalytics(impl: AnalyticsInitializer): FeatureInitializer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Binds</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @IntoSet</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    abstract fun bindCrashReporter(impl: CrashReporterInitializer): FeatureInitializer</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class AppInitializer @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val initializers: Set&#x3C;@JvmSuppressWildcards FeatureInitializer></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun initializeAll() {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        initializers.sortedBy { it.priority }.forEach { it.initialize() }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Module</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@InstallIn(SingletonComponent::class)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>abstract class HandlerModule {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Binds</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @IntoMap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @StringKey(\"push\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    abstract fun bindPushHandler(impl: PushNotificationHandler): NotificationHandler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @Binds</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @IntoMap</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    @StringKey(\"email\")</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    abstract fun bindEmailHandler(impl: EmailNotificationHandler): NotificationHandler</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>@Singleton</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>class NotificationDispatcher @Inject constructor(</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    private val handlers: Map&#x3C;String, @JvmSuppressWildcards NotificationHandler></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    fun dispatch(type: String, payload: NotificationPayload) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>        handlers[type]?.handle(payload)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[AnalyticsInitializer] --&gt;|&quot;@IntoSet&quot;| D[&quot;Set&amp;lt;FeatureInitializer&amp;gt;&quot;]&#10;    B[CrashReporterInitializer] --&gt;|&quot;@IntoSet&quot;| D&#10;    C[LoggingInitializer] --&gt;|&quot;@IntoSet&quot;| D&#10;    D --&gt; E[AppInitializer]&#10;&#10;    F[PushHandler] --&gt;|&quot;@IntoMap&quot;| I[&quot;Map&amp;lt;String, Handler&amp;gt;&quot;]&#10;    G[EmailHandler] --&gt;|&quot;@IntoMap&quot;| I&#10;    H[SmsHandler] --&gt;|&quot;@IntoMap&quot;| I&#10;    I --&gt; J[NotificationDispatcher]&#10;&#10;    classDef setStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    classDef mapStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px&#10;    class D setStyle&#10;    class I mapStyle\">graph TD\n    A[AnalyticsInitializer] --&gt;|\"@IntoSet\"| D[\"Set&amp;lt;FeatureInitializer&amp;gt;\"]\n    B[CrashReporterInitializer] --&gt;|\"@IntoSet\"| D\n    C[LoggingInitializer] --&gt;|\"@IntoSet\"| D\n    D --&gt; E[AppInitializer]\n\n    F[PushHandler] --&gt;|\"@IntoMap\"| I[\"Map&amp;lt;String, Handler&amp;gt;\"]\n    G[EmailHandler] --&gt;|\"@IntoMap\"| I\n    H[SmsHandler] --&gt;|\"@IntoMap\"| I\n    I --&gt; J[NotificationDispatcher]\n\n    classDef setStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    classDef mapStyle stroke:#333,stroke-width:2px\n    class D setStyle\n    class I mapStyle</pre><blockquote>\n<p><strong>提示：</strong> Multibindings 中注入 <code>Set&lt;T&gt;</code> 或 <code>Map&lt;K, V&gt;</code> 时，需要在泛型参数上添加 <code>@JvmSuppressWildcards</code>，否则 Kotlin 编译器会生成通配符类型导致 Dagger 无法匹配。</p>\n</blockquote>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li><code>@Singleton</code> 提供全局唯一实例，避免过度使用以减少内存占用</li>\n<li><code>@ViewModelScoped</code> 在 ViewModel 内共享依赖，<code>@ActivityRetainedScoped</code> 跨配置变更存活</li>\n<li>自定义组件通过 <code>@DefineComponent</code> 实现特殊的作用域需求</li>\n<li>Multibindings 将多个实现收集到 Set 或 Map，适合插件化和策略模式架构</li>\n<li>作用域的选择应基于依赖的实际生命周期需求，不要盲目使用 <code>@Singleton</code></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"作用域与绑定","id":"作用域与绑定"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"@Singleton","id":"singleton"},{"level":2,"text":"@ViewModelScoped","id":"viewmodelscoped"},{"level":2,"text":"@ActivityRetainedScoped","id":"activityretainedscoped"},{"level":2,"text":"自定义组件","id":"自定义组件"},{"level":2,"text":"Multibindings","id":"multibindings"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"Hilt 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/dependency-injection/hilt-fundamentals"},"next":{"title":"Hilt 测试","url":"/l-doc-books/h/mobile/android-development/dependency-injection/testing-with-hilt"}}